[2019-10-29T17:56:58Z | ewertons | comment]
This issue was originally filed using the iothub_device_client module.
According to verification done with the latest version of the azure-iot-sdk-c code ([2019-10-07](https://github.com/Azure/azure-iot-sdk-c/releases/tag/2019-10-07)), the issue can no longer be reproduced.

The verification was done by creating and destroying the iothub_device_client handle (using iothub_device_client.h API and AMQP protocol) for 10000 times in a row, with wait times in between creation and destruction of 1000 milliseconds, 500 milliseconds, 250 milliseconds, 100 milliseconds.
